[s27] The company will host a conference call with the financial community on Tuesday, October 27, 2026 at 4:30 p.m. U.S. Eastern Daylight Time (EDT) to review the third quarter 2026 results in detail.
[s28] A replay of the call will be available on the NXP Investor Relations website within 24 hours of the actual call.
[s29] The company has operations in more than 30 countries and posted revenue of $12.27 billion in 2025.
